"view.parans.help.results"      = "There are two tabs: 'Positions' and 'Matches'.\n\nUnder 'Positions' you see a table with all factors and fixed stars you have selected in the configuration, with the times of rising, setting, culmination and anti-culmination. The times shown are in UT.\n\nThe 'Matches' tab shows a table of the parans found. On the left you see fixed stars or factors, the type of paran and the time. Then a factor with again the type of paran and the time, and finally the orb in minutes and seconds. Here too the times are in UT.";
